<newsitem itemid="358296" id="root" date="1997-02-05" xml:lang="en">
<title>USA: Castelle Inc Q4 shr increases.</title>
<headline>Castelle Inc Q4 shr increases.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, California 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>						    Three months ended</p>
<p>						    12/31/96     12/31/95</p>
<p> Net sales					  $ 8,525     $ 7,265</p>
<p> Net income					   3,166	   696</p>
<p> Net income per share				0.68	  0.19</p>
<p> Shares used in per share calculation	 4,651	 3,706</p>
<p>						    Year ended</p>
<p>						    12/31/96     12/31/95</p>
<p> Net sales					 $32,725	$28,173</p>
<p> Net income					  5,643	  2,083</p>
<p> Net income per share			     1.20	   0.59</p>
<p> Shares used in per share calculation	4,702	  3,519</p>
<p>NOTE - Q4 1996 includes a one-time acquisition charge of $1.4 million and a one-time tax benefit of $3.7 million. Excluding those items, Q4 shr was $0.19.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
